//   leaves insideConstrainedOut/currentConstrainedOut unchanged (was valid, stays valid).
//   EOS + close branch: same as close above. EOS + no-close break: no state change,
//   invariant preserved. GroupBoostedConstrainedStep returns EOS or a parser-valid token
